<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-wenshizhi" book-id="b-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts" chapter-id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts" source-id="s-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts">
  <p id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:burial" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="epitaph_as_modernly_transcribed">泰和六年□月廿九日晉故散騎常侍新建開國侯太原郡祁縣都鄉仁義里<persName id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:burial:m0030" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5_B">溫式之</persName>葬</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:father" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="epitaph_as_modernly_transcribed">考使持節侍中大將軍始安郡忠武公諱<persName id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:father:m0016" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">嶠</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:father:m0018" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">太真</persName></p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:brother" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="epitaph_as_modernly_transcribed">兄使持節輔國將軍交州刺史襲封始安公諱<persName id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:brother:m0018" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5_A">放之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-wenshizhi-excerpts:brother:m0021" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5_A">弘祖</persName></p>
</text>
